 "_": "Tool flange plate: the ISO 9409-1-50-4-M6 pattern, centred on the screw axis, and the rear end of the two side walls — four Ø4.3 through it into their end faces, so the robot’s load is axial on those bolts. It carries no grip load; the grip tension runs between the front wall and the back wall. Four Ø6.6 on a 50 PCD at 45°, a Ø6 dowel at 0°, a Ø32 hole for the robot flange boss (no recess: the boss enters the case). One extrude along -Y.",
